    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see it as a practical tool rather than an abstract art. Since I love CS and biology, math helps me understand logic in code or patterns in nature. It's not my favorite subject like physics or chemistry are to some, but I don't hate it either. It's just useful when needed.",
