    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes! I used an AI tutor for biology statistics and found it very helpful. It explained concepts step-by-step without judging me. For math, it helped visualize graphs instead of giving just formulas. I appreciated the personalized pace, which suited my moderate anxiety levels well.",
