    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize tutoring by adapting explanations to student needs. They can visualize concepts interactively, reducing anxiety. Teachers could use them for instant feedback on complex problems instead of grading every formula manually. Imagine a chatbot guiding students through biology data analysis while keeping math fun and less abstract."
